Beyond $12\,\mathrm{V}$, $R=V/I$ falls --- B true.
At $V=14\,\mathrm{V}$, $I=7\,\mathrm{A}$ so $R=2\,\Omega$ --- D true.
At $I=5\,\mathrm{A}$ on the steep part, $V\approx 13\,\mathrm{V}$ so $R\approx 2.6\,\Omega$, not $0.5\,\Omega$.
$\Rightarrow$ \textbf{C} is incorrect.}

